abstract: >-
  An open-source library of professional Agent Skills — plain-markdown SKILL.md
  files that teach AI assistants to produce professional-grade work (PRDs,
  postmortems, contract decoding, negotiations) — plus SkillSpec, a conformance
  standard for skill files, and SkillBench, a benchmark measuring model
  performance on professional knowledge work.
